<title>THAILAND: Thai Oct foreign reserves rise to US$39.9 bln.</title>
<headline>Thai Oct foreign reserves rise to US$39.9 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves rose in October to US$39.9 billion from $39.5 billion in September, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES     Oct 96    Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p>					 39.9	 39.5	 35.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
